#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/1
msgid ""
"Huey, your ID card isn't working.\n"
msgstr ""
"休伊，你的ID卡不管用。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/2
msgid ""
"It won't open the lock!\n"
msgstr ""
"打不开锁！\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/3
msgid ""
"...It can't be...\n"
msgstr ""
"…不可能…\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/4
msgid ""
"What's going on?!\n"
msgstr ""
"怎么了？！\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/5
msgid ""
"She hates me that much?!\n"
msgstr ""
"她就那么恨我？！\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/6
msgid ""
"...Strangelove's in charge of authorizing\n"
"IDs.\n"
msgstr ""
"……Strangelove负责授权\n"
"ID。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/7
msgid ""
"Sometimes a working card has its\n"
"privileges removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"有时候一张能用的卡会被\n"
"取消权限。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/8
msgid ""
"...Say, if she decides she doesn't like that\n"
"card's carrier.\n"
msgstr ""
"……比如，如果她不喜欢那张\n"
"卡的持有者。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/9
msgid ""
"You think that's what happened?\n"
msgstr ""
"你觉得是这样？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/10
msgid ""
"Well, I was never exactly her favorite.\n"
msgstr ""
"反正我从不是她的红人。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/11
msgid ""
"Well, this could be tricky.\n"
msgstr ""
"这下麻烦了。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/12
msgid ""
"The soldiers outside aren't allowed in the\n"
"lab either, so their cards won't do you\n"
"any good...\n"
msgstr ""
"外面的士兵也不被允许进入\n"
"实验室，所以他们的卡对你\n"
"没用……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/13
msgid ""
"Great...\n"
msgstr ""
"好极了……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/14
msgid ""
"Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/15
msgid ""
"Kaz, where's Cecile?\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，塞西尔呢？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/16
msgid ""
"She just got here. Hold on.\n"
msgstr ""
"她刚到。等等。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/18
msgid ""
"Cecile. How'd it feel to fly?\n"
msgstr ""
"塞西尔。飞得爽吗？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/19
msgid ""
"Wonderful. For a moment, I felt what it\n"
"must be like to be a bird.\n"
msgstr ""
"太棒了。一瞬间，我仿佛成了鸟\n"
"。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/20
msgid ""
"It almost made me want to give up my\n"
"research and get a pilot's license...\n"
msgstr ""
"这几乎让我想放弃我的\n"
"研究去考个飞行员执照……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/21
msgid ""
"Did you need something?\n"
msgstr ""
"你找我有事？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/22
msgid ""
"You said you'd gotten an ID card, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"你说你弄到过ID卡，对吧？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/23
msgid ""
"Yes. But it was confiscated when the\n"
"guards caught me.\n"
msgstr ""
"是的。但警卫抓住我时\n"
"把它没收了。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/24
msgid ""
"Who took it?! What'd he look like?!\n"
msgstr ""
"谁拿的？！他长啥样？！\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/25
msgid ""
"He had on an orange jacket.\n"
msgstr ""
"他穿着橙色夹克。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/26
msgid ""
"I... cannot recall his face, though.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我记不清他的脸。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/27
msgid ""
"Yeah, they all look pretty much the same.\n"
"Where did it happen?\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊，它们看着都差不多。\n"
"这是在哪发生的？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/28
msgid ""
"Let me think...\n"
msgstr ""
"让我想想……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/29
msgid ""
"Ah, yes! I do remember hearing the song\n"
"of a nearby quetzal.\n"
msgstr ""
"啊对！我记得听到附近凤尾绿咬鹃的\n"
"歌声。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/30
msgid ""
"Just what I'd expect from a birder.\n"
msgstr ""
"不愧是观鸟人。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/31
msgid ""
"Would you like to hear it?\n"
msgstr ""
"你想听听吗？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/32
msgid ""
"Hmm? What's that song?\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯？什么叫声？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/33
msgid ""
"It's my quetzal. I took it with me when I\n"
"was rescued.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是我的凤尾绿咬鹃。我被救出来的时候\n"
"把它带上了。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/34
msgid ""
"Didn't you say something about them\n"
"being covered under the Washington\n"
"Convention...\n"
msgstr ""
"你不是说过它们\n"
"受《华盛顿\n"
"公约》保护吗……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/35
msgid ""
"Just kidding. That was just me... an\n"
"imitation.\n"
msgstr ""
"开玩笑的。那只是我……\n"
"模仿的。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/36
msgid ""
"An essential skill for any ornithologist.\n"
"Pretty good, no?\n"
msgstr ""
"这是鸟类学家必备的技能。\n"
"很不错吧？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/37
msgid ""
"Damn good.\n"
msgstr ""
"真像。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/38
msgid ""
"If you want to hear the quetzal's song\n"
"again, just let me know.\n"
msgstr ""
"想再听一次凤尾绿咬鹃的歌声，\n"
"告诉我就行。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/39
msgid ""
"I can tell you all about the birds of Costa\n"
"Rica, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"我也能给你讲哥斯达黎加的\n"
"各种鸟类。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/40
msgid ""
"Yeah... will do. Thanks, Cecile.\n"
msgstr ""
"好……一定。谢了，塞西尔。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/41
msgid ""
"No, no, thank you, Snake. Talk to you\n"
"soon.\n"
msgstr ""
"不不，谢谢你，Snake。回头\n"
"聊。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/42
msgid ""
"Kaz, did you play that tape for Cecile?\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，那盘磁带放给塞西尔听了吗？\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/43
msgid ""
"I sure did. It's hers, all right.\n"
msgstr ""
"放了。确实是她的。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/44
msgid ""
"Then she must be...\n"
msgstr ""
"那她准是……\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/45
msgid ""
"She's not. Cecile says she's never even\n"
"met Paz.\n"
msgstr ""
"她不是。塞西尔说她根本\n"
"没见过帕兹。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/47
msgid ""
"She's at least 10 years too old.\n"
msgstr ""
"她至少老了10岁。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/49
msgid ""
"I'm guessing Paz convinced herself that it\n"
"was the tape her friend made.\n"
msgstr ""
"我猜帕兹说服了自己，那\n"
"是她朋友录的磁带。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/50
msgid ""
"But never mind that. Let's go over what\n"
"we know so far.\n"
msgstr ""
"先别管。我们梳理下\n"
"目前线索。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/51
msgid ""
"The soldier with the ID card is wearing an\n"
"orange jacket\n"
msgstr ""
"持有ID卡的士兵穿着\n"
"橙色夹克\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/52
msgid ""
"and is in a location where you'll hear\n"
"quetzals singing.\n"
msgstr ""
"位置在能听到\n"
"凤尾绿咬鹃鸣叫的地方。\n"

#: codec/2/907/0x38b170/53
msgid ""
"Find that soldier. Retrieve that card.\n"
msgstr ""
"找到那个士兵。取回ID卡。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c0c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, to gain access to the lab you'll\n"
"need an ID card.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，要进入实验室\n"
"你需要一张ID卡。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c0c0/1
msgid ""
"You can get one from a guard in an\n"
"orange jacket stationed in an area where\n"
"you can hear quetzals singing.\n"
msgstr ""
"可从穿橙夹克的守卫\n"
"身上拿到，他驻守在\n"
"能听到凤尾绿咬鹃鸣叫处。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c0c0/2
msgid ""
"To get the ID card from the soldier, do a\n"
"body check.\n"
msgstr ""
"要从士兵身上拿ID卡，\n"
"就对他搜身。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c0c0/3
msgid ""
"You've got to get inside that lab before\n"
"the AI gets shipped out. Get a move on!\n"
msgstr ""
"你必须在AI被运走前\n"
"进入实验室。抓紧行动！\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c2c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, that's the Chrysalis weapon Huey\n"
"was referring to.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，那就是休伊提到的\n"
"蝶蛹武器。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c2c0/1
msgid ""
"You know what to do!\n"
msgstr ""
"你知道该怎么做！\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/1
msgid ""
"She played me like a piano...\n"
msgstr ""
"她把我耍得团团转……\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/2
msgid ""
"Forget about it. You'll get 'em back.\n"
msgstr ""
"别想了。你会夺回来的。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/3
msgid ""
"That is, as long as you've got the will to\n"
"do it.\n"
msgstr ""
"前提是你有\n"
"这个决心。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/4
msgid ""
"I'm not giving up.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不放弃。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/5
msgid ""
"All right, then...\n"
msgstr ""
"那好……\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/6
msgid ""
"I confirmed the location with Huey.\n"
msgstr ""
"我向休伊确认了位置。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/7
msgid ""
"The final testing base for Peace Walker is\n"
"15 miles to the north of that lab.\n"
msgstr ""
"和平行者的最终测试基地\n"
"在实验室以北15英里处。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/8
msgid ""
"It's an underground facility disguised as a\n"
"rock quarry.\n"
msgstr ""
"那是个伪装成采石场的\n"
"地下设施。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/9
msgid ""
"All you need to do is sneak in and\n"
"destroy the AI for good this time.\n"
msgstr ""
"你只需潜入进去，\n"
"这次彻底摧毁AI。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/11
msgid ""
"Snake, you can destroy it, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你能摧毁它吧？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/13
msgid ""
"We all have our limits - actions beyond\n"
"our abilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们都有极限——\n"
"力所不能及的事。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/14
msgid ""
"Don't worry. I won't screw it up this time.\n"
msgstr ""
"别担心，这次我不会搞砸。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/15
msgid ""
"You're the one who killed The Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS是你杀的。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/16
msgid ""
"Destroying that AI means reliving that\n"
"memory.\n"
msgstr ""
"毁掉那台AI，等于重温那段\n"
"记忆。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/17
msgid ""
"It's just a machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"只是台机器。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/18
msgid ""
"Snake, I'm worried.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，我很担心。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/19
msgid ""
"Worried?\n"
msgstr ""
"担心？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/20
msgid ""
"For the same reason the CIA entrusted\n"
"the nuclear launch to an AI.\n"
msgstr ""
"CIA把核弹发射交给AI，也是\n"
"同样的道理。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/21
msgid ""
"A man can condemn a handful of\n"
"criminals to the death penalty\n"
msgstr ""
"一个人可以判处少数\n"
"罪犯死刑\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/22
msgid ""
"if they're prepared to assume that\n"
"responsibility.\n"
msgstr ""
"如果他们准备好承担\n"
"这份责任。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/23
msgid ""
"But who among us could do the same to\n"
"hundreds of millions of innocent civilians?\n"
msgstr ""
"可谁能对数亿无辜平民下\n"
"同样的手？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/24
msgid ""
"Who could reduce thousands of years of\n"
"human history to ash in an instant?\n"
msgstr ""
"谁能把数千年人类历史\n"
"瞬间化为灰烬？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/25
msgid ""
"Could any flesh-and-blood human being\n"
"make that decision?\n"
msgstr ""
"血肉之躯的人，做得出\n"
"这种决定吗？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/26
msgid ""
"No way in hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"绝不可能。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/27
msgid ""
"No one man could bear the burden of\n"
"total genocide.\n"
msgstr ""
"没人扛得起种族灭绝的\n"
"重担。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/28
msgid ""
"It's what's allowed our cowardly species\n"
"to survive all this time.\n"
msgstr ""
"正因如此，我们这懦弱的\n"
"物种才活到今天。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/29
msgid ""
"But for a machine, willpower is no issue.\n"
msgstr ""
"但机器没有意志问题。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/30
msgid ""
"What are you saying, Kaz?\n"
msgstr ""
"你想说什么，卡兹？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/31
msgid ""
"You're a hero, Snake. But you're not a\n"
"machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"你是英雄，SNAKE。但你不是\n"
"机器。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/32
msgid ""
"That I can't destroy that thing?\n"
msgstr ""
"我毁不掉那东西？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/33
msgid ""
"That machine's not the problem. It's that\n"
"The Boss still lives - inside of you.\n"
msgstr ""
"问题不在那台机器。是THE BOSS\n"
"还活在你心里。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/34
msgid ""
"Bullshit!\n"
msgstr ""
"胡说！\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/35
msgid ""
"She's dead, Snake. It's time to come to\n"
"terms with that.\n"
msgstr ""
"她死了，SNAKE。该接受\n"
"现实了。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/36
msgid ""
"Let me put it another way.\n"
msgstr ""
"我换个说法。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/37
msgid ""
"You've left everything behind - your\n"
"country, your identity, your past and\n"
"ideals...\n"
msgstr ""
"你抛下了一切——你的\n"
"国家、身份、过去和\n"
"理想……\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/38
msgid ""
"But there's still one thing you haven't let\n"
"go of.\n"
msgstr ""
"但有一样东西你还没\n"
"放下。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/40
msgid ""
"The Boss. You still haven't let her go.\n"
msgstr ""
"THE BOSS。你还是没能放下她。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/41
msgid ""
"That's why you're so afraid to find out\n"
"the truth about her.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以你才这么害怕查明\n"
"她的真相。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/42
msgid ""
"And that's what's holding you back from\n"
"your future.\n"
msgstr ""
"也正是这让你无法迈向\n"
"未来。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/43
msgid ""
"Snake, she died a decade ago.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，她都死了十年了。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/44
msgid ""
"How long can you live with a ghost?\n"
msgstr ""
"你带个亡魂能活多久？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/45
msgid ""
"Kaz, I thought I knew everything about\n"
"her.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kaz, I thought I knew everything about\n"
"her.\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/46
msgid ""
"But I still don't understand what\n"
"happened to her at the end.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我始终不明白她最后\n"
"到底发生了什么。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/47
msgid ""
"There you are no different from that\n"
"scientist woman.\n"
msgstr ""
"这点上你和那个女科学家\n"
"没什么两样。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/48
msgid ""
"When she didn't believe me, I realized\n"
"something.\n"
msgstr ""
"When she didn't believe me, I realized\n"
"something.\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/49
msgid ""
"That debriefing I heard could've been part\n"
"of the cover story they made up.\n"
msgstr ""
"我听到的那份简报可能是\n"
"他们编造的掩饰。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/50
msgid ""
"Now even I'm not sure what her real\n"
"intentions were.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在连我都不确定她的真实\n"
"意图。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/51
msgid ""
"Why did she take that mission?\n"
msgstr ""
"她为何接那任务？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/52
msgid ""
"How did she feel about dying?\n"
msgstr ""
"她怎么看待死？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/53
msgid ""
"Why was I chosen?\n"
msgstr ""
"为何选我？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/54
msgid ""
"You want to know the truth?\n"
msgstr ""
"你想知道真相？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/55
msgid ""
"The truth won't change the past. You still\n"
"want to know?\n"
msgstr ""
"真相改变不了过去。你还\n"
"想知道吗？\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/56
msgid ""
"...No. I took on this mission for a kid who\n"
"believes in peace.\n"
msgstr ""
"……不。我接这任务\n"
"是为一个信和平的孩子。\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/57
msgid ""
"Hm. Fine, then. There's no point in\n"
"arguing. Peace Walker is on the verge of\n"
"completion.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hm. Fine, then. There's no point in\n"
"arguing. Peace Walker is on the verge of\n"
"completion.\n"

#: codec/2/908/0x38c3b0/58
msgid ""
"C'mon, Boss. Let's get to that base!\n"
msgstr ""
"来吧，BOSS。去那座基地！\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d5b0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, the Peace Walker platform and AI\n"
"have been shipped to the final testing\n"
"base.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake, the Peace Walker platform and AI\n"
"have been shipped to the final testing\n"
"base.\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d5b0/1
msgid ""
"Once assembled, it's only a matter of\n"
"time before they launch the nukes. Hurry!\n"
msgstr ""
"一旦组装完成，他们发射核弹\n"
"就只是时间问题。快！\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d6f0/0
msgid ""
"Dammit, you've been spotted by the\n"
"guards! Take them out before they take\n"
"you out!\n"
msgstr ""
"Dammit, you've been spotted by the\n"
"guards! Take them out before they take\n"
"you out!\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d7c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake! That's Huey's unmanned weapon -\n"
"the Cocoon! Put it out of commission!\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE！那是休伊的无人武器——\n"
"茧！把它废掉！\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d890/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Peace Walker is in a hangar at the\n"
"very bottom of the mine.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，和平行者在矿井\n"
"最底层的机库里。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d890/1
msgid ""
"Infiltrate the base and put a stop to the\n"
"project by destroying Peace Walker's AI\n"
"pod.\n"
msgstr ""
"Infiltrate the base and put a stop to the\n"
"project by destroying Peace Walker's AI\n"
"pod.\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d9d0/0
msgid ""
"...Snake, I hope you can hear me.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，希望你能听到。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d9d0/1
msgid ""
"Word is you've been captured by\n"
"Strangelove.\n"
msgstr ""
"听说你被\n"
"Strangelove抓走了。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d9d0/2
msgid ""
"I'm guessing they confiscated your gear.\n"
"But I know you've still got something left.\n"
msgstr ""
"装备八成被没收了。\n"
"但你肯定还有别的东西。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38d9d0/3
msgid ""
"Search your memory, Snake!\n"
msgstr ""
"好好想想，SNAKE！\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/2
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/2
msgid ""
"It's good to hear your voice again.\n"
msgstr ""
"又能听到你的声音了。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/3
msgid ""
"Kaz, how about something a little sharper\n"
"next time.\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，下次给我把\n"
"更锋利点的。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/4
msgid ""
"You got it. How about a diamond-bladed\n"
"jigsaw?\n"
msgstr ""
"明白。来把\n"
"金刚石锯片的线锯？\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/5
msgid ""
"And, ah, when's the \"next time\" gonna be,\n"
"anyway?\n"
msgstr ""
"那个……「下次」\n"
"到底是什么时候？\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/6
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/3
msgid ""
"Sorry! Hey, you OK?\n"
msgstr ""
"抱歉！你没事吧？\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/7
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/4
msgid ""
"Yeah.... Lungs taste like charcoal.\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯……肺里全是焦味。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/8
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/5
msgid ""
"No smoking for you for a while, huh?\n"
msgstr ""
"你得戒烟一阵子了。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/9
msgid ""
"Nah, I'll be fine. The pain in my chest is\n"
"gone...\n"
msgstr ""
"没事，我挺得住。\n"
"胸口的疼痛已经消失……\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/10
msgid ""
"So, that was just a copy of The Boss'\n"
"wound?\n"
msgstr ""
"也就是说，那只是仿照\n"
"The Boss的伤口？\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/11
msgid ""
"That's right. The scar's gone now.\n"
msgstr ""
"没错。疤痕已经消失了。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/12
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/7
msgid ""
"Nice work.\n"
msgstr ""
"干得好。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/13
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/8
msgid ""
"What's the situation with you? Everyone\n"
"OK?\n"
msgstr ""
"你那边如何？大家\n"
"都好吗？\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/14
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/9
msgid ""
"Yeah... But there's a slight problem. I can't\n"
"get a hold of Paz.\n"
msgstr ""
"嗯……但有个小问题。联系不上\n"
"帕兹。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/15
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/10
msgid ""
"Paz? I thought the \"professor\" was\n"
"looking after her?\n"
msgstr ""
"帕兹？不是那位\"教授\"在\n"
"照顾她吗？\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/16
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/11
msgid ""
"So did I. Here's the deal.\n"
msgstr ""
"我也这么想。情况是这样。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/17
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/12
msgid ""
"I started thinking, and I sent someone\n"
"over to the \"school\" the \"professor\"\n"
"mentioned.\n"
msgstr ""
"我开始琢磨，就派人去了\n"
"\"教授\"提到的\n"
"那所\"学校\"。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/18
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/13
msgid ""
"...And the \"school\" doesn't exist?\n"
msgstr ""
"……结果\"学校\"不存在？\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/19
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/14
msgid ""
"No, it exists, but Paz has been a no-show.\n"
msgstr ""
"不，存在，但帕兹没露面。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/20
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/15
msgid ""
"The person at the school said neither the\n"
"\"professor\"\n"
msgstr ""
"The person at the school said neither the\n"
"\"professor\"\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/21
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/16
msgid ""
"nor Paz had been seen there in quite\n"
"some time.\n"
msgstr ""
"和Paz都很久\n"
"没在那出现了。\n"

#: codec/2/909/0x38db70/22
#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/17
msgid ""
"...Coldman knew about us. We've been\n"
"marked by the CIA.\n"
msgstr ""
"……科尔德曼知道我们。我们被\n"
"CIA盯上了。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/6
msgid ""
"Nah, I'll be fine. I'd better get moving.\n"
msgstr ""
"没事，我撑得住。该走了。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/18
msgid ""
"The KGB and Paz brought us into all this.\n"
"Coldman must know about them, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"是克格勃和帕兹把我们卷进来的。\n"
"科尔德曼肯定也知道他们。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/19
msgid ""
"You think... Coldman's got them...?\n"
msgstr ""
"你是说……科尔德曼抓了他们……？\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/20
msgid ""
"No. Remember, Gálvez isn't some\n"
"pencil-pusher.\n"
msgstr ""
"不。加尔维斯可不是\n"
"坐办公室的。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/21
msgid ""
"Yeah... The KGB'll have eyes on Coldman\n"
"night and day, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"对……克格勃也会日夜盯着\n"
"科尔德曼。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/22
msgid ""
"Which could mean they knew what the\n"
"CIA would try to do and are just staying\n"
"out of sight...\n"
msgstr ""
"也就是说，他们可能知道CIA\n"
"想干什么，只是躲起来\n"
"不露面……\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/23
msgid ""
"Let's hope so. See what you can get out\n"
"of the KGB, Kaz.\n"
msgstr ""
"希望如此。去克格勃那里\n"
"套点东西，Kaz。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/24
msgid ""
"All right. Back to work.\n"
msgstr ""
"好，继续干活。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/25
msgid ""
"I'd better get moving.\n"
msgstr ""
"我得走了。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/26
msgid ""
"Snake, we haven't detected any signs\n"
"that Peace Walker's been activated,\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，我们还没发现任何迹象\n"
"表明Peace Walker已启动，\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/27
msgid ""
"at least from above ground.\n"
msgstr ""
"至少地面上没有。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/28
msgid ""
"It's still in the hangar you were in earlier.\n"
msgstr ""
"它还在你之前去过的机库里。\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/29
msgid ""
"This time, it's really our last chance.\n"
"Destroy that AI!\n"
msgstr ""
"这次真是最后机会。\n"
"摧毁那个AI！\n"

#: codec/2/910/0x38e660/30
msgid ""
"On my way.\n"
msgstr ""
"就去。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f0e0/0
msgid ""
"Peace Walker's active, and its\n"
"self-defense system is targeting you,\n"
"Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"Peace Walker启动了，它的\n"
"自卫系统正瞄准你，\n"
"Snake。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f0e0/1
msgid ""
"You'd better find a way to stop it, quick!\n"
msgstr ""
"你最好快点想办法阻止它！\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/1
msgid ""
"Kaz, Peace Walker's gone... They've got\n"
"Paz, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kaz，Peace Walker不见了……他们还\n"
"抓走了Paz。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/3
msgid ""
"Why, Kaz? What would Coldman want with\n"
"Paz?\n"
msgstr ""
"为什么，Kaz？Coldman要\n"
"Paz干嘛？\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/4
msgid ""
"Paz was with the \"professor\", i.e., the\n"
"KGB.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paz和那个“教授”在一起，也就是\n"
"克格勃。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/5
msgid ""
"Once Coldman discovered that, he figured\n"
"out what was really going on between\n"
"Paz and Gálvez.\n"
msgstr ""
"Coldman一发现这点，就弄清了\n"
"Paz和Gálvez之间\n"
"到底是怎么回事。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/6
msgid ""
"He's trying to figure out how the KGB\n"
"plan to stop Peace Walker,\n"
msgstr ""
"他正试图弄清克格勃\n"
"打算如何阻止Peace Walker，\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/7
msgid ""
"and he thinks he can get the info from\n"
"Paz.\n"
msgstr ""
"他认为能从\n"
"Paz那里得到情报。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/8
msgid ""
"That's crazy! Paz won't know anything.\n"
msgstr ""
"疯了！帕兹什么都不知道。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/9
msgid ""
"Yeah, well, he probably doesn't buy that.\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊，可他大概不信。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/10
msgid ""
"...You think Gálvez has already been\n"
"killed? By grabbing Paz, Coldman's saying...\n"
msgstr ""
"……你觉得Gálvez已经被\n"
"杀了吗？抓走Paz，Coldman是在说……\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/11
msgid ""
"\"Stay out of this, or lose your client.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"“别插手，不然丢客户。”\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/12
msgid ""
"Dammit! I can't believe we didn't realize\n"
"what was going on before we lost\n"
"contact with Paz.\n"
msgstr ""
"该死！真不敢相信和Paz\n"
"失去联系前，竟没意识到\n"
"发生了什么。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/13
msgid ""
"Don't have time for that, Kaz.\n"
msgstr ""
"没空说这个，卡兹。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/15
msgid ""
"Paz needs our help.\n"
msgstr ""
"帕兹要帮忙。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/16
msgid ""
"Right. This isn't about money anymore.\n"
"You better move. We know where they're\n"
"headed.\n"
msgstr ""
"对。这不再是钱的事。\n"
"你最好行动。我们知道\n"
"他们去哪了。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/18
msgid ""
"You can thank Amanda.\n"
msgstr ""
"得谢阿曼达。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/19
msgid ""
"Snake, that river you chased the basilisco\n"
"across is the Rio San Juan.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你追蛇怪渡过的河\n"
"是圣胡安河。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/20
msgid ""
"The other side is our country.\n"
msgstr ""
"对岸是我们国家。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/21
msgid ""
"I had some Nicaraguan compas track it\n"
"there.\n"
msgstr ""
"I had some Nicaraguan compas track it\n"
"there.\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/22
msgid ""
"They're focos from the GPP (Guerra\n"
"Popular Prolongada) faction,\n"
msgstr ""
"他们是GPP（持久人民战争）\n"
"派的据点，\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/23
msgid ""
"so we don't work together so much...\n"
msgstr ""
"所以我们不太合作……\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/24
msgid ""
"Where'd it go?\n"
msgstr ""
"哪去了？\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/25
msgid ""
"West, along the border, towards Lago\n"
"Cocibolca.\n"
msgstr ""
"West, along the border, towards Lago\n"
"Cocibolca.\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/26
msgid ""
"There's a U.S. military supply base on the\n"
"southeastern shore of the lake.\n"
msgstr ""
"There's a U.S. military supply base on the\n"
"southeastern shore of the lake.\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/27
msgid ""
"Ever since that earthquake two years\n"
"ago, America's had the entire region to\n"
"itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ever since that earthquake two years\n"
"ago, America's had the entire region to\n"
"itself.\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/28
msgid ""
"That is where the basilisco is. I'm sure of\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"That is where the basilisco is. I'm sure of\n"
"it.\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/29
msgid ""
"Lago Cocibolca... How do I get across the\n"
"border?\n"
msgstr ""
"Lago Cocibolca……我怎么过\n"
"边境？\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/30
msgid ""
"There's a route that we use to cross.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们有一条过境的路线。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/31
msgid ""
"It's just a little boat, but I can introduce\n"
"you to the captain.\n"
msgstr ""
"只是小船，但我能介绍\n"
"船长给你。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/32
msgid ""
"I appreciate it.\n"
msgstr ""
"多谢。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/33
msgid ""
"We will never leave Nicaragua at the\n"
"mercy of someone like William Walker\n"
"again.\n"
msgstr ""
"绝不让尼加拉瓜再落入\n"
"William Walker之流\n"
"手中。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/34
msgid ""
"Snake, Coldman's going to launch the\n"
"nuke from that base. He's targeting MSF.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，Coldman要从那基地\n"
"发射核弹。目标MSF。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/35
msgid ""
"Based on what Huey's told us, it'll take\n"
"two more days to prep for launch.\n"
msgstr ""
"据Huey说，还需\n"
"两天准备发射。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/36
msgid ""
"...But it looks like there's another reason\n"
"they picked that date.\n"
msgstr ""
"……但选那日子似乎\n"
"另有原因。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/38
msgid ""
"Tomorrow is day one of a U.S.-Soviet\n"
"summit in Vladivostok.\n"
msgstr ""
"明天是美苏\n"
"符拉迪沃斯托克峰会首日。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/39
msgid ""
"The launch is probably connected\n"
"somehow.\n"
msgstr ""
"发射可能与此\n"
"有关。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/40
msgid ""
"That's right... They're holding the SALT-II\n"
"(Strategic Arms Limitation Treaty) talks.\n"
msgstr ""
"对……他们在开SALT-II\n"
"（限制战略武器条约）会谈。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/41
msgid ""
"You think Coldman's trying to disrupt the\n"
"negotiations?\n"
msgstr ""
"你觉得Coldman想破坏\n"
"谈判？\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/42
msgid ""
"Either that, or use it as a bargaining chip...\n"
msgstr ""
"要么如此，要么拿它当筹码……\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/43
msgid ""
"He's still got Paz, too. At any rate, we're\n"
"running out of time.\n"
msgstr ""
"他还抓了Paz。总之，我们\n"
"没时间了。\n"

#: codec/2/911/0x38f200/44
msgid ""
"I'll figure something out.\n"
msgstr ""
"我会想办法的。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390090/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Peace Walker has crossed the\n"
"border\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，Peace Walker 已越过\n"
"边境\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390090/1
msgid ""
"and entered a U.S. military supply base\n"
"on the southeastern shore of Lago\n"
"Cocibolca.\n"
msgstr ""
"并进入了位于科西博尔卡湖\n"
"东南岸的一处美军\n"
"补给基地。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390090/2
msgid ""
"Coldman's targeting the MSF plant -\n"
"that's us.\n"
msgstr ""
"科尔德曼的目标是MSF工厂——\n"
"就是我们。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390090/3
msgid ""
"Don't let it launch that nuke! Destroy\n"
"Peace Walker!\n"
msgstr ""
"别让它发射核弹！摧毁\n"
"和平行者！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390250/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Peace Walker's being controlled\n"
"from the control tower! It's to the\n"
"northeast.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，Peace Walker 正被\n"
"控制塔操控着！它就在\n"
"东北方向。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390250/1
msgid ""
"Get going! We'll be there to back you up!\n"
msgstr ""
"快去吧！我们会支援你！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390370/0
msgid ""
"Snake, don't let it launch the nuke!\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，别让它发射核弹！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390410/0
msgid ""
"Snake! You have to stop that data from\n"
"being sent!\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE！必须阻止数据\n"
"被发送出去！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3904c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, we've got a problem. Zadornov's\n"
"not in his cell.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，出事了。扎多尔诺夫\n"
"不在牢房。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3904c0/2
msgid ""
"He must have used his prosthetic as a\n"
"blowtorch to cut through the bars.\n"
msgstr ""
"他肯定用假肢当喷灯\n"
"烧断了铁栏。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3904c0/3
msgid ""
"But we've managed to narrow down his\n"
"location using a transmitter we planted\n"
"on him.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过我们在他身上装了发信器，\n"
"已经缩小了他的\n"
"位置范围。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3904c0/4
msgid ""
"I'm adding a new mission. Find the KGB\n"
"agent Zadornov!\n"
msgstr ""
"新任务。找到\n"
"克格勃特工扎多尔诺夫！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3906d0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov has escaped custody.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫逃走了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3906d0/1
#: codec/2/912/0x390b50/1
#: codec/2/912/0x390e90/1
msgid ""
"Find him!\n"
msgstr ""
"找到他！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3907a0/0
msgid ""
"Heh heh... So you found me.\n"
msgstr ""
"嘿嘿……你找到我了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3907a0/1
msgid ""
"It wasn't hard. What're you up to, anyway?\n"
msgstr ""
"不难找。你到底想干什么？\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3907a0/2
msgid ""
"Just... going for a stroll.\n"
msgstr ""
"只是……散散步。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3907a0/3
msgid ""
"Kaz, I've got Zadornov. Returning home.\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，我抓到扎多尔诺夫了。回基地。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3907a0/4
msgid ""
"Acknowledged, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"收到，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/0
msgid ""
"Bad news, Snake. Zadornov's on the loose.\n"
msgstr ""
"坏消息，SNAKE。扎多尔诺夫跑了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/1
msgid ""
"What, again?!\n"
msgstr ""
"什么，又跑了？！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/2
msgid ""
"It's funny. We took away his prosthetic\n"
"and did a full body check.\n"
msgstr ""
"说来好笑。拿走了他假肢，\n"
"还做了全身检查。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/3
msgid ""
"We even increased the guard.\n"
msgstr ""
"甚至加了守卫。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/4
msgid ""
"Think he had help?\n"
msgstr ""
"有人帮他？\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/5
msgid ""
"Impossible. Anyway, I'm adding a new\n"
"mission. Locate and recover Zadornov!\n"
msgstr ""
"不可能。总之，加了新任务。\n"
"找到并带回扎多尔诺夫！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390b50/0
#: codec/2/912/0x390e90/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov's disappeared from his\n"
"cell again.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫又\n"
"从牢房消失了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390c30/0
msgid ""
"Kaz, I caught Zadornov.\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，扎多尔诺夫抓到了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390c30/1
msgid ""
"I-impossible! I thought I'd made it...\n"
msgstr ""
"不可能！我以为搞定了……\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390c30/2
msgid ""
"Acknowledged. And appreciated.\n"
msgstr ""
"收到。辛苦了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390d50/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov has disappeared from\n"
"his cell.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫\n"
"从牢房消失了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390d50/1
msgid ""
"What? You're kidding, right?\n"
msgstr ""
"什么？你开玩笑吧？\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390d50/2
msgid ""
"Afraid not. You've got a new mission: find\n"
"Zadornov!\n"
msgstr ""
"没开玩笑。新任务：找到\n"
"扎多尔诺夫！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390f70/0
msgid ""
"I got him, Kaz.\n"
msgstr ""
"抓到了，卡兹。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390f70/1
msgid ""
"...Slipped up again...\n"
msgstr ""
"……又砸了……\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390f70/2
msgid ""
"Acknowledged. Bring him on in.\n"
msgstr ""
"收到。带他进来。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/0
msgid ""
"Umm... Snake?\n"
msgstr ""
"呃……SNAKE？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/1
msgid ""
"Don't tell me... Zadornov?\n"
msgstr ""
"别告诉我……扎多尔诺夫？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/2
msgid ""
"Bingo. The guard left his post and the\n"
"dude was gone when he got back.\n"
msgstr ""
"答对了。守卫擅离职守，回来时\n"
"人已经不见了。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/3
msgid ""
"Sounds like the guard needs a guard.\n"
msgstr ""
"看来守卫也需要人看着。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/4
msgid ""
"He was off with the girls. Paz invited him\n"
"to try some of their cooking.\n"
msgstr ""
"他去找姑娘们了。帕兹请他\n"
"尝尝她们做的菜。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/5
msgid ""
"He says he loved every second of it.\n"
msgstr ""
"他说他每一秒都很享受。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/6
msgid ""
"Is that jealousy, Kaz?\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，你嫉妒？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/7
msgid ""
"Anyway, there's a new mission waiting for\n"
"you. Find Zadornov, Snake!\n"
msgstr ""
"总之，新任务在等你。\n"
"找到扎多尔诺夫，SNAKE！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/8
msgid ""
"Okay, okay...\n"
msgstr ""
"好，好……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/0
#: codec/2/913/0x391350/2
msgid ""
"Snake! Zadornov's done it again!\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE！扎多尔诺夫又跑了！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/1
msgid ""
"great...\n"
msgstr ""
"太好了……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/3
msgid ""
"Gimme a break...\n"
msgstr ""
"饶了我吧……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/4
msgid ""
"Snake! Listen, Zadornov's done it again!\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE！扎多尔诺夫又跑了！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/5
msgid ""
"C'mon!\n"
msgstr ""
"拜托！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/6
msgid ""
"I hate to entertain the thought, but this\n"
"might be an inside job.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不想这么想，但这\n"
"可能是内鬼干的。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/7
msgid ""
"What the hell's he after, anyway?\n"
msgstr ""
"他到底想干嘛？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/8
msgid ""
"No clue. Can't imagine he's just out to\n"
"annoy us, though.\n"
msgstr ""
"毫无头绪。不过，我无法想象他只是来\n"
"惹恼我们的。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/9
msgid ""
"You know, it might not be worth keeping\n"
"him here. If he's not going to join us...\n"
msgstr ""
"你知道，也许不值得把他\n"
"留在这里。如果他不加入我们……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/10
msgid ""
"You may be right.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许你对。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/11
msgid ""
"I thought it might boost our Russian\n"
"compatriots' morale, but...\n"
msgstr ""
"我以为能提振俄罗斯\n"
"同胞士气，但……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/12
msgid ""
"OK. I'll think it over.\n"
msgstr ""
"好。我再想想。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/13
msgid ""
"Let's hope he's just playing\n"
"hide-and-seek...\n"
msgstr ""
"希望他只是在玩\n"
"捉迷藏……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/14
msgid ""
"I've added a new mission. Go get\n"
"Zadornov!\n"
msgstr ""
"新增任务。去抓\n"
"扎多诺夫！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3917c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov's disappeared again.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫又没了。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3917c0/1
msgid ""
"Get out there and retrieve him!\n"
msgstr ""
"出去把他找回来！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3918a0/0
msgid ""
"Found our friend, Kaz.\n"
msgstr ""
"找到他，卡兹。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3918a0/1
msgid ""
"...Damn it... And I was so close ...\n"
msgstr ""
"……该死……就差一点……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3918a0/2
msgid ""
"Great. Good work, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"干得好，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3919b0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov's escaped custody again.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫又逃走了。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3919b0/1
msgid ""
"You have to track him down!\n"
msgstr ""
"你得把他追回来！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391a90/0
msgid ""
"I found him, Kaz.\n"
msgstr ""
"找到他，卡兹。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391a90/1
msgid ""
"Close... but no cigar.\n"
msgstr ""
"差一点，没成。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391a90/2
msgid ""
"Not for you, anyway. Snake, We're coming\n"
"to pick him up.\n"
msgstr ""
"反正不是给你。斯内克，我们来\n"
"接他。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, you're not gonna believe this, but...\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，你肯定不信，但……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/2
msgid ""
"Zadornov's missing again.\n"
msgstr ""
"扎多尔诺夫又不见了。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/3
msgid ""
"Kaz, are you sure somebody's not... I don't\n"
"know, letting him out on purpose?\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，你确定没有人……我不知道，\n"
"故意放他出去？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/4
msgid ""
"You think I have time to assemble a mole\n"
"hunt?\n"
msgstr ""
"你觉得我有空抓\n"
"内鬼吗？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/5
msgid ""
"Man, this guy isn't just good, he's so good\n"
"it's scary.\n"
msgstr ""
"天，这家伙不光厉害，简直\n"
"吓人。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/6
msgid ""
"If he's doing this alone, that is.\n"
msgstr ""
"前提是他一个人干的。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/7
msgid ""
"Anyway, he left a trail, so we've got a\n"
"good idea of where he's probably hiding.\n"
msgstr ""
"总之他留下踪迹，我们大致\n"
"知道他可能藏哪。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/8
msgid ""
"You know what the mission is...\n"
msgstr ""
"任务内容你知道……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/9
msgid ""
"Find Zadornov, Snake!\n"
msgstr ""
"找到扎多尔诺夫，SNAKE！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391ef0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov's escaped. You have to\n"
"find him!\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫逃了。快\n"
"找到他！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391fa0/0
msgid ""
"Kaz, I've located Zadornov.\n"
msgstr ""
"卡兹，我找到扎多尔诺夫了。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/0
msgid ""
"It, ah, happened again, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"又、又来了，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/1
msgid ""
"Zadornov? What's he got, an escape\n"
"fetish?\n"
msgstr ""
"扎多尔诺夫？逃上瘾了\n"
"不成？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/2
msgid ""
"He clearly has friends on the inside,\n"
msgstr ""
"他显然有内应，\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/3
msgid ""
"but we've got no way of knowing who.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我们查不出是谁。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/4
msgid ""
"Ugh. Persistent bastard, I'll give him that.\n"
"Where is he this time?\n"
msgstr ""
"唉。这家伙真够顽固的。\n"
"这次他在哪？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/5
msgid ""
"That's the thing. He must've found and\n"
"gotten rid of the transmitter.\n"
msgstr ""
"问题就在这。他肯定找到并\n"
"拆掉了发信器。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/6
msgid ""
"We've got no idea where he is. Snake,\n"
"think you can find him?\n"
msgstr ""
"不知他在哪。SNAKE，\n"
"你能找到他吗？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/7
msgid ""
"...We can't just let him run around -\n"
"makes us look bad.\n"
msgstr ""
"……不能让他到处乱跑——\n"
"太丢脸了。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/8
msgid ""
"I'll say. Since we can't locate him, I'm\n"
"afraid I can't add a new mission.\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊。既然找不到他，恐怕\n"
"没法新增任务。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/9
msgid ""
"You know what to do, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"你知道咋做，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/0
msgid ""
"Snake, you there?\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，在吗？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/1
msgid ""
"Yeah. What's up?\n"
msgstr ""
"在。怎么了？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/2
msgid ""
"You've gotta talk to Amanda.\n"
msgstr ""
"你得找阿曼达谈谈。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/3
msgid ""
"What happened?\n"
msgstr ""
"怎么了？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/4
msgid ""
"She wants to leave sickbay and get back\n"
"on the battlefield, but she's not fully\n"
"healed.\n"
msgstr ""
"她想离开医务室重返\n"
"战场，但伤还没\n"
"痊愈。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/5
msgid ""
"She's still in crutches - who'd be crazy\n"
"enough to try and fight like that?!\n"
msgstr ""
"她还拄着拐杖——谁会疯到\n"
"那样去打仗？！\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/6
msgid ""
"You have to talk some sense into her.\n"
msgstr ""
"你得劝劝她。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/7
msgid ""
"Is she with you right now?\n"
msgstr ""
"她跟你在一起？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/8
msgid ""
"No, she's in sickbay.\n"
msgstr ""
"不，她在医务室。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/9
msgid ""
"She keeps shouting about how she\n"
"doesn't want to be there.\n"
msgstr ""
"她一直嚷嚷着不想\n"
"待在那。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/10
msgid ""
"She won't shut up about it. She's driving\n"
"me-\n"
msgstr ""
"她没完没了，快把我\n"
"逼——\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/11
msgid ""
"Let her go.\n"
msgstr ""
"让她去吧。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/13
msgid ""
"If that's what she wants, let her go.\n"
msgstr ""
"既然她想去，就让她去吧。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/14
msgid ""
"I'm really not in the mood for jokes, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"我真没心情开玩笑，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/15
msgid ""
"I'm serious. Let her go.\n"
msgstr ""
"真的。让她去。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/16
msgid ""
"Why? So she can come back in a body\n"
"bag?\n"
msgstr ""
"为啥？好让她装尸袋\n"
"回来？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/17
msgid ""
"I'm really not in the mood for jokes, Kaz.\n"
msgstr ""
"我真没心情开玩笑，卡兹。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/19
msgid ""
"Amanda isn't the type to just sit around\n"
"in sickbay.\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达不会乖乖\n"
"躺医务室。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/20
msgid ""
"She has a sense of duty - her purpose in\n"
"life is to fight.\n"
msgstr ""
"她有责任感——她人生的\n"
"意义就是战斗。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/21
msgid ""
"The battlefield isn't just the best thing\n"
"for her, it's the best thing for her\n"
"compas, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"战场对她来说不仅是最适合的地方，\n"
"对她的部下来说\n"
"也是如此。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/22
msgid ""
"She'll be a huge morale boost - that can\n"
"only benefit MSF.\n"
msgstr ""
"她能极大鼓舞士气，\n"
"对MSF只有好处。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/24
msgid ""
"You're good at fighting, Kaz - one of the\n"
"best...\n"
msgstr ""
"你善战，卡兹，数一\n"
"数二……\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/25
msgid ""
"but you've got a lot to learn when it\n"
"comes to people.\n"
msgstr ""
"但与人相处，\n"
"你还有很多要学。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/26
msgid ""
"... So where should I put her?\n"
msgstr ""
"……那把她编到哪？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/27
msgid ""
"I'll think it over and find a team for her.\n"
msgstr ""
"我考虑一下，给她找个队伍。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/28
msgid ""
"Don't worry, she won't let us down.\n"
msgstr ""
"放心，她不会让我们失望的。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/29
msgid ""
"Whatever you say, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"随你吧，BOSS。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/0
msgid ""
"I got a report in from the R&D team.\n"
msgstr ""
"研发组来了份报告。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/1
msgid ""
"They've finished plans for a new hex-type\n"
"plant.\n"
msgstr ""
"新型六边形工厂\n"
"已设计完成。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/2
msgid ""
"And today they're gonna start\n"
"construction on the first block.\n"
msgstr ""
"今天他们就要开始\n"
"第一区的建设了。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/3
msgid ""
"Can't wait to finally say goodbye to this\n"
"scrap heap.\n"
msgstr ""
"真希望能早日告别这个\n"
"破铜烂铁堆。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/4
msgid ""
"Only thing is, we don't have nearly\n"
"enough GMP.\n"
msgstr ""
"只是我们的GMP\n"
"远远不够。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/5
msgid ""
"We'll need to recruit more soldiers to get\n"
"more GMP. You know what to do, Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"得招募更多士兵来获取\n"
"更多GMP。你知道怎么做，斯内克。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392f70/0
msgid ""
"Snake, I got another report from the\n"
"R&D team.\n"
msgstr ""
"Snake，研发组\n"
"又给了我一份报告。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/0
msgid ""
"Got a sec, Snake?\n"
msgstr ""
"有空吗，SNAKE？\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/2
msgid ""
"It's about Paz. You know, she doesn't\n"
"have any family.\n"
msgstr ""
"关于帕兹。你知道，她\n"
"没有家人。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/3
msgid ""
"She got a scholarship thanks to\n"
"Zadornov, and was living at the dorms...\n"
msgstr ""
"多亏扎多诺夫，她拿到\n"
"奖学金，一直住宿舍……\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/4
msgid ""
"But he was KGB.\n"
msgstr ""
"可他是克格勃。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/5
msgid ""
"All signs are her scholarship came from\n"
"the KGB, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"迹象表明她奖学金也来自\n"
"克格勃。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/6
msgid ""
"Even if they let him go, she's not going to\n"
"be seeing any more money.\n"
msgstr ""
"就算他们放了她，她也拿不到\n"
"更多钱了。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/7
msgid ""
"It wouldn't have been much anyway.\n"
msgstr ""
"反正本来也没多少。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/8
msgid ""
"So I was wondering, what about letting\n"
"her stay here a while?\n"
msgstr ""
"所以我在想，能不能让她\n"
"在这待一阵子？\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/9
msgid ""
"What does she think?\n"
msgstr ""
"她怎么想？\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/10
msgid ""
"She says she wants to help out.\n"
msgstr ""
"她说她想帮忙。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/11
msgid ""
"It would only be temporary. She's still in\n"
"shock.\n"
msgstr ""
"只是暂时的。她还没\n"
"缓过来。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/12
msgid ""
"Right now, no one understands her better\n"
"than we do.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在没人比我们更\n"
"了解她。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/13
msgid ""
"OK. But Kaz,\n"
msgstr ""
"确定。但卡兹，\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/14
msgid ""
"don't take your eyes off her.\n"
msgstr ""
"别让她离开视线。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/16
msgid ""
"It won't be easy getting used to this kind\n"
"of life.\n"
msgstr ""
"适应这种生活可\n"
"不容易。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/17
msgid ""
"I know, Snake. I'm not trying to turn her\n"
"into one of us.\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道，SNAKE。我不是想让她\n"
"变成我们的人。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/18
msgid ""
"You should talk to her yourself later.\n"
msgstr ""
"你回头自己跟她谈谈。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/20
msgid ""
"And, ah,\n"
msgstr ""
"还有，呃，\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/21
msgid ""
"Dr. Strangelove wants to come, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"斯特兰奇洛夫博士也想来。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/22
#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/3
msgid ""
"Strangelove?\n"
msgstr ""
"斯特兰奇洛夫？\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/23
msgid ""
"Well she's out of a job now, and she'd\n"
"have a problem returning to England.\n"
msgstr ""
"她现在没工作了，回\n"
"英国也有麻烦。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/24
msgid ""
"You can talk to her about it.\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以跟她谈。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/25
msgid ""
"Anyway, you don't need me to tell you\n"
"how good she'd be for R&D.\n"
msgstr ""
"总之不用我说你也知道\n"
"她对研发有多重要。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/0
msgid ""
"Thanks for putting me on the R&D team,\n"
"Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"谢谢你让我进研发组，\n"
"Snake。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/1
msgid ""
"I'll cut to the chase.\n"
msgstr ""
"我就直说了。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/2
msgid ""
"We've commenced development on our\n"
"own bipedal weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们已经开始研发\n"
"自己的双足兵器。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/3
msgid ""
"The only thing is we don't exactly have\n"
"easy access to resources here.\n"
msgstr ""
"唯一的问题是，我们在这里\n"
"不容易搞到资源。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/4
msgid ""
"Yeah, unfortunately we don't have the\n"
"budget of a defense department behind\n"
"us.\n"
msgstr ""
"是啊，可惜我们没有\n"
"国防部那样的预算\n"
"在背后撑着。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/5
msgid ""
"I understand. That's why I want to ask\n"
"you something.\n"
msgstr ""
"我明白。所以我想\n"
"拜托你一件事。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/6
msgid ""
"If you fight any more AI weapons,\n"
msgstr ""
"如果再遇到AI兵器，\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/7
msgid ""
"could you try to gather as many of their\n"
"parts as you can?\n"
msgstr ""
"能不能尽量多收集\n"
"它们的部件？\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/8
msgid ""
"That would really make things go a lot\n"
"smoother.\n"
msgstr ""
"那样事情会\n"
"顺利很多。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/9
msgid ""
"Again, easier said than done.\n"
msgstr ""
"又是说起来容易。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/10
msgid ""
"If anyone can do it, you can, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""
"要是有人做得到，那就是你，老大。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/11
msgid ""
"You single-handedly took out the Pupa.\n"
msgstr ""
"你一个人就干掉了Pupa。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/12
msgid ""
"True.\n"
msgstr ""
"没错。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/13
msgid ""
"Look, if you're not interested, I can just\n"
"work with what we have here.\n"
msgstr ""
"听我说，你要是没兴趣，\n"
"我就用手头现有的凑合。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/14
msgid ""
"I'm not trying to force you to take\n"
"unnecessary risks. You're the boss\n"
"around here.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不想逼你去冒\n"
"不必要的险。\n"
"这里你是老大。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/15
msgid ""
"All right. No promises, but I'll think about\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"好吧。不敢保证，\n"
"但我会考虑。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/16
msgid ""
"Great.\n"
msgstr ""
"太好了。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/17
msgid ""
"Also, each AI weapon has a \"head part\"\n"
"that serves as the core of its armament.\n"
msgstr ""
"另外，每台AI兵器都有一个「头部部件」，\n"
"是其武装的核心。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/18
msgid ""
"Recovering a head part will allow you to\n"
"use the weapon associated with that part.\n"
msgstr ""
"回收头部部件，\n"
"就能使用对应的武器。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/19
msgid ""
"...But those guys won't go down without a\n"
"fight.\n"
msgstr ""
"……可那些家伙\n"
"不会乖乖倒下。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/20
msgid ""
"So don't get too preoccupied with this\n"
"stuff.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以别太执着于\n"
"这些东西。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/21
msgid ""
"Don't worry. I'm not about to risk my life\n"
"for a bunch of scrap.\n"
msgstr ""
"放心。我不会为了一堆废铁\n"
"拿命去冒险。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/22
msgid ""
"I would hope not.\n"
msgstr ""
"希望如此。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/23
msgid ""
"One more thing: our new bipedal weapon\n"
"needs a name.\n"
msgstr ""
"还有一件事：我们新的双足兵器\n"
"需要个名字。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/24
msgid ""
"Good point.\n"
msgstr ""
"说得对。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/25
msgid ""
"We can't keep calling it \"our bipedal\n"
"weapon.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"总不能一直叫它\n"
"「我们的双足兵器」。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/26
msgid ""
"I had a talk with Miller, and we came up\n"
"with \"Metal Gear ZEKE.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"我和米勒商量过，\n"
"想出了「Metal Gear ZEKE」。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x3939d0/27
msgid ""
"Metal Gear... ZEKE...?\n"
msgstr ""
"Metal Gear……ZEKE……？\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, we fitted ZEKE with its own AI Pod.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，我们给ZEKE装了AI舱。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/1
msgid ""
"We were having trouble adjusting the AI,\n"
msgstr ""
"AI调试一直不顺，\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/2
msgid ""
"but Dr. Strangelove was able to get it up\n"
"and running.\n"
msgstr ""
"但斯特兰奇洛夫博士把它\n"
"弄好能跑了。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/4
msgid ""
"Why the surprise, Snake?\n"
msgstr ""
"惊讶什么，SNAKE？\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/5
msgid ""
"Well... We're an army without borders.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个嘛……我们是没有国界的军队。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/6
msgid ""
"We need a deterrent against foreign\n"
"intervention - that's what ZEKE is for.\n"
msgstr ""
"我们需要威慑外国\n"
"干涉——ZEKE就是为此。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/7
msgid ""
"It may even prove necessary to...\n"
msgstr ""
"甚至可能有必要……\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/8
msgid ""
"I'm not against deterrence itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"我并不反对威慑本身。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/9
msgid ""
"The problem is when a nation comes to\n"
"rely on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"问题在于，国家开始\n"
"依赖它时。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/10
msgid ""
"All that does is force a burden on its\n"
"people...\n"
msgstr ""
"这样做只会给其\n"
"人民带来负担……\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/11
msgid ""
"the same people that constitute the\n"
"nation itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"而这些人正是构成\n"
"国家本身的人。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/12
msgid ""
"The existence of nations is detrimental to\n"
"man.\n"
msgstr ""
"国家的存在对\n"
"人类是有害的。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/13
msgid ""
"That's why I, one without a nation, see\n"
"potential in MSF.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以我这无国之人，才在MSF看到\n"
"潜力。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/14
msgid ""
"But power is required for you to distance\n"
"yourself from nations.\n"
msgstr ""
"但你需要力量才能让自己\n"
"远离国家。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/15
msgid ""
"I will do whatever I can to assist with that.\n"
msgstr ""
"我会尽力协助你。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/16
msgid ""
"...Glad to hear it.\n"
msgstr ""
"……太好了。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/17
msgid ""
"And... I merely lent Huey a helping hand.\n"
msgstr ""
"而且……我只是帮了休伊。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/18
msgid ""
"I will not give ZEKE an AI like hers.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不会给ZEKE装那种AI。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/19
msgid ""
"I wouldn't expect you to.\n"
msgstr ""
"我也没指望你会。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, I'm proud to announce that\n"
"preparations for Metal Gear ZEKE are\n"
"complete.\n"
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，我荣幸宣布，\n"
"合金装备·ZEKE准备\n"
"完成。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 1462..2048
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/1
msgid ""
"We can activate it any time.\n"
msgstr ""
"随时可以启动。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 2048..2702
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/2
msgid ""
"Got it. Thanks, Huey.\n"
msgstr ""
"明白。谢了，休伊。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 2758..3176
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/3
msgid ""
"No need to thank me.\n"
msgstr ""
"不用谢我。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 3218..4068
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/4
msgid ""
"At least now I can finally say I helped you\n"
"with something.\n"
msgstr ""
"至少现在我能说，\n"
"我帮上你忙了。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 4151..4806
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/5
msgid ""
"You can use it in Outer Ops, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"外层作战也能用。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 4876..5712
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/6
msgid ""
"Just select ZEKE when you're forming\n"
"your unit.\n"
msgstr ""
"在组建部队时\n"
"选择ZEKE即可。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 5795..6492
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/7
msgid ""
"Be sure to take it out for a field test.\n"
msgstr ""
"一定要带它去做实地测试。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 6798..7815
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/9
msgid ""
"You can change weapons and check\n"
"memory boards just like before.\n"
msgstr ""
"可以像以前一样更换武器、\n"
"查看记忆板。\n"
